[en.FOCUS_C01_DEM_CHANGE]
Masterly Inactivity

[en.FOCUS_C01_DEM_CHANGE_desc]
Fancy Pants met the Empress again, and this time, the Empress rarely dismissed all her guards, leaving only her and Fancy Pants in the palace.\n“You know,” the Empress said, “I’ve been thinking all the time, about things I should do.”\n“Your Majesty,” Fancy Pants said, “You have done a lot of things.”\n“Yes,” the Empress said, “I’ve done a lot of things. Only to realize that your advice was right. I should think more about things I shouldn’t do.”\nFancy Pants felt more and more different about this meeting, but didn’t know how to respond.\n\nAfter a long time, the Empress finally spoke again: “I’m tired now, Fancy Pants. From now on, you should act as what you think is right.”

[zh.FOCUS_C01_DEM_CHANGE]
无为而治

[zh.FOCUS_C01_DEM_CHANGE_desc]
花花短裤又一次见到了女皇，而这一次，女皇罕见的支开了所有卫兵，皇宫内只剩下了她和花花短裤。\n“你知道，” 女皇说，“之前，我一直在想，我是不是应该做点什么。”\n“陛下，” 花花短裤说，“您已经做了很多事情。”\n“是啊，” 女皇说，“我做了很多事情。但我现在才意识到你的当初建议是对的。我更应该，不做什么。”\n花花短裤愈发感觉到这次会议的不同，但却不知道该如何回答。\n\n良久，女皇终于再次开口：“我也累了，花花短裤。以后，按你想的去做吧。”

